# Cursor Rules — CineTrekker Android

Before making any code modifications in this workspace, you MUST review the canonical documentation:
- AI_RULES.md — Engineering authority and core principles
- PROJECT_CONTEXT.md — Current system state and feature map
- ARCHITECTURE.md — System layers, offline queue, and technical invariants
- DEFINITION_OF_DONE.md — Quality gates and completion checklist

Key Standards:
- Do not guess or invent APIs, models, or routes.
- Reuse widgets in `lib/shared/widgets/` and services in `lib/core/`.
- Verify with `flutter analyze` and `flutter test`.
- Keep `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` and `CHANGELOG.md` updated after changes.
